{"sha": "cb41cfc7153974f93096684e34cf52bf2e6e8d864a90f7b0886856029dda646f", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "    width=11.6cm, height=5.8cm, xmin=0, xmax=14, ymin=0, ymax=0.62,", "    xlabel={$r/a_0$}, ylabel={$P(r)$（每 $a_0$）},", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.1)}, anchor=north},", "    xtick={1,4,5,10}, ytick=\\empty, clip=false,", "    legend style={font=\\scriptsize, at={(0.95,0.9)}, anchor=north east,", "      draw=none, fill=none}]", "    \\addplot[omDef, very thick, domain=0:8, samples=120] {4*x*x*exp(-2*x)};", "    \\addlegendentry{$1s$}", "    \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:14, samples=140] {0.125*x*x*(2-x)^2*exp(-x)};", "    \\addlegendentry{$2s$}", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=0:14, samples=140] {x^4*exp(-x)/24};", "    \\addlegendentry{$2p$}", "    \\draw[gray, dashed] (axis cs:1,0) -- (axis cs:1,0.545);", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 径向概率密度。$1s$ 态的峰恰好位于", "$a_0$ 处；$2s$ 态带有一个球面节点，以及一个靠近原子核的瓣——", "即将决定元素周期表次序的“穿透”效应，而", "$2p$ 态受离心势垒阻隔，", "远离原子核。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[读取尺寸]\\label{ex:b3:hydrogen-atom:sizes}", "基态：直径 \\qty{0.1}{nm}，束缚能 \\qty{13.6}{eV}，", "正是全部化学的尺度。当 $n = 10$ 时：半径 $\\sim\\qty{5}{nm}$，", "束缚能 \\qty{0.136}{eV}，束缚松散。当 $n = 100$ 时：一个", "\\emph{微米}量级的原子，束缚能 \\qty{1.4}{meV}，极弱的", "场即可破坏它——然而星际空间足够空旷，", "使这类原子得以存活并“广播”", "（见\\cref{pb:b3:hydrogen-atom:1}）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{光谱}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[线系与选择定则]\\label{prop:b3:hydrogen-atom:series}", "\\index{巴耳末线系}\\index{赖曼线系}", "一次 $n' \\to n$ 的跃迁发出的波长为", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{\\lambda} = R_{\\text{H}}\\Big(\\frac{1}{n^2} -", "\\frac{1}{n'^2}\\Big) , \\qquad", "R_{\\text{H}} = \\frac{E_{\\text{I}}}{hc} = \\qty{1.097e7}{m^{-1}} ,", "\\]", "遵从偶极选择定则 $\\Delta l = \\pm1$（光子", "携带 $\\hbar$）。赖曼线系（$\\to n = 1$）位于远", "紫外区，始于 \\qty{121.6}{nm}；巴耳末线系（$\\to n = 2$）", "始于红色的 $H\\alpha$ 谱线 \\qty{656.3}{nm}，正是发射星云与日珥的颜色；", "帕邢线系及之后各线系移入红外区，", "在 $n = 110$ 与 $109$ 之间，同一公式落在", "\\qty{5.0}{GHz} 处，氢原子从", "紫外一直“说”到无线电波段。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由能量守恒，并结合\\cref{thm:b3:hydrogen-atom:levels}；", "$R_{\\text{H}}$ 与\\cref{pb:b3:hamiltonian-mechanics:1}中相同，此处", "由推导得出，而非假设。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[类氢原子：一个解，多种原子]\\label{ex:b3:hydrogen-atom:scaling}", "将质子的电荷换为 $Ze$，并把电子换为任意绕转的", "质量 $\\mu$：每个公式按下式重新标度：", "\\[", "a \\to a_0\\,\\frac{m_{\\text{e}}}{\\mu}\\,\\frac1Z , \\qquad", "E_{\\text{I}} \\to E_{\\text{I}}\\,\\frac{\\mu}{m_{\\text{e}}}\\,Z^2 .", "\\]", "He$^+$（$Z = 2$）：\\qty{54.4}{eV}。重原子的内层电子", "（$Z \\sim 30$）：K 壳层能量处于 keV 量级，即莫塞莱借以排列元素次序的", "特征 X 射线", "（见\\cref{exo:b3:hydrogen-atom:5}）。μ 子氢（$\\mu = 207", "m_{\\text{e}}$）：飞米量级的原子，直接探测质子本身。", "正电子素（$e^+e^-$，$\\mu = m_{\\text{e}}/2$）：束缚能减半，", "尺寸加倍，寿命短暂，最终以湮灭光子结束。", "而在半导体中，电子与空穴", "在屏蔽性电介质中，以较小的有效质量相互绕转：一个", "\\emph{激子}，即同一原子膨胀至十纳米、", "束缚能降至毫电子伏量级（见\\cref{exo:b3:hydrogen-atom:7}）——氢与其说是原子，", "不如说是一个模板。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  % size comparison, hand-drawn", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, fill=omDef!12] (1.2,0) circle (1.05);", "  \\fill[omDef] (1.2,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\node[align=center, font=\\footnotesize] at (1.2,-1.75)", "    {氢\\\\$a_0$，\\qty{-13.6}{eV}};", "  \\draw[omThm, thick, fill=omThm!12] (4.6,0) circle (0.42);", "  \\fill[omThm] (4.6,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\node[align=center, font=\\footnotesize] at (4.6,-1.75)", "    {μ 子氢\\\\$a_0/207$（此处为 $\\times 40$）\\\\\\qty{-2.5}{keV}};", "  \\draw[omExo, thick, fill=omExo!12] (8.1,0) circle (1.55);", "  \\fill[omExo] (8.1,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\node[align=center, font=\\footnotesize] at (8.1,-2.25)", "    {正电子素\\\\$2a_0$，\\qty{-6.8}{eV}};", "  \\draw[omProp, thick, fill=omProp!10] (12.4,0) circle (2.0);", "  \\fill[omProp] (12.4,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\node[align=center, font=\\footnotesize] at (12.4,-2.75)", "    {晶体中的激子\\\\$\\sim 170\\,a_0$（此处为 $\\div 50$）\\\\$\\sim\\qty{-7}{meV}$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 一个解，四种“原子”：通过重标度质量、电荷与", "介电环境，氢原子便成为探测质子的工具、", "纯量子电动力学的检验，以及半导体中发光的", "类原子。}", "\\end{omfigure}", ""]}